== Walkthrough ==

Upon creating a Dark Elf Magician, you will have a tattered note in your inventory. The note reads as follows:

: Seek out [[Jayna D`Bious | Jayna D'Bious]] of the Spurned. She is the master magician in the Tower of the Spurned. Give her this note, and she will tutor you in the ways of magic.

Upon handing the note to [[Jayna D`Bious]]:

: [[Jayna D`Bious]] says, 'Welcome, young magician. I am Jayna D'Bious. You have much to learn, so lets get you started. Here is your guild tunic'

<div class='facblock'>
* Your faction standings with [[The Spurned]] got better.
* Your faction standings with [[The Dead]] got worse.
</div>

{{YouGainExperience}}

You also receive the [[Crimson Training Tunic*]]. Good luck, Mage!

